    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Location, Location, Location...\r\n\r\nLocations don't come much more convenient than one occupied by 'Cooldriona Court' on Well Road, Swords. Situated just off Dublin Street and almost directly opposite Penneys and the entrance to Swords Central Shopping Centre residents of this small private development enjoy an  abundance of amenities on their doorstep. An eclectic choice of entertainment and a variety leisure facilities can be enjoyed in the immediate neighbourhood. \r\n\r\nNo.35A Cooldriona Court comprises a second floor apartment that is ready for immediate occupation. The smartly presented living accommodation extends to c.386 sq ft/36 sq m and briefly comprises of an entrance hall, living room cum dining room with kitchenette, bedroom and en suite shower room. Dual pedestrian access is available along Well Road and on the Dublin Road opposite Penney's. \r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and can be arranged by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 5.21m x 4.42m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - 4.25m x 3.53m \r\nWith Hot Press\r\n\r\nEn-suite - 1.47m x 1.63m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Well-Presented One Bedroom 2nd Floor Apt.\r\nDesignated Car Space\r\nNew Kitchen & Renovated En Suite\r\nAll New Flooring Throughout\r\nSuperbly Convenient Location\r\nWalking Distance To All Amenities\r\nAdjacent To Swords Main Street & Pavillions S.C.\r\nExcellent Transport Links\r\n2025 Annual Service Charge - c.€1,773.13 (Sinking Fund Contribution €666.25)\r\nNo Rent Cap"
      },
